{"step_index":124,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:07:50Z","input_tokens":5018,"cache_read_tokens":101354,"output_tokens":519,"content":"I have created a comprehensive technical implementation plan for all three requested capabilities.\n\nPlease review the complete plan in the artifact:\n👉 [**Implementation Plan: AegisShield Advanced Features**](file:///C:/Users/thann/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f941cc48-3dd0-4ea9-a4df-91daf625a4db/plan.md)\n\n### Key Decisions & Highlights:\n1. **Allow / Block Policy Engine:**\n   - **Allowlist (Whitelist):** Mark processes, paths, or SHA256 hashes as trusted to suppress alerts and prevent termination.\n   - **Blocklist (Blacklist):** Mark processes, hashes, or remote IPs to auto-terminate or block via Windows Firewall (`netsh advfirewall`).\n2. **Email Reporting System:**\n   - Full HTML executive incident report with threat tables, network sockets, active RMM sessions, and remediation logs.\n   - Configurable SMTP (Gmail, Outlook, custom corporate SMTP) with test dispatch and on-demand or automated critical alert triggers.\n3. **Network Intelligence & Origin Tracer:**\n   - Audits every process using network sockets (local port $\\rightarrow$ remote IP:port, protocol, and state).\n   - Reverse DNS hostname resolution and geographical lookup (Country, City, ISP, ASN).\n   - **Genuineness Classification:** Classifies endpoints into `GENUINE CLOUD / CDN` (Microsoft, Google, Cloudflare, AWS, etc.), `PRIVATE LAN`, `SUSPICIOUS C2 / RAT`, `ANONYMIZED / TOR`, or `UNVERIFIED EXTERNAL`.\n\nPlease review the plan and click **Proceed** (or let me know if you would like any adjustments) so I can begin implementation!"}
